  1. Noiseless Aer reproduces near-Tsirelson per pair S~2.82; real hardware would show fidelity decay + chained-register decoherence; optional $25 IBM Heron anchor DECLINED
  2. CSCS chain construction is "register-isolation" (3 pairs in one statevector); "temporal-sequential" (3 pairs back-to-back on 2 qubits with reset) is OUT OF SCOPE
  3. S formula deviation: SSOT compute_S uses S=E_ab-E_abp+E_apb+E_apbp which gives S~0 on noiseless Aer with the canonical (0,pi/2,pi/4,-pi/4) angles; cscs_runner uses canonical S=E_ab+E_abp+E_apb-E_apbp giving S~+2.83. SSOT works only for cond.3 hardware sign pattern, needs amendment in sister cycle.
  4. indep_pvalue_min=0.00026 is a multiple-testing artifact (240 tests under null), NOT an independence failure; only indep_pvalue_mean is the falsifier-bearing statistic
